Right now the launcher passes 3, which is smaller than 15, 8 and 5. So the budget above never actually applies — the effective limit is always 3. ^3C61MES9

The counter becomes 1 after the first trap/threat full move. It then increases after every later full move, whether or not another trap or threat occurs. Reaching 8 means the original trap/threat full move plus seven later full moves—not eight traps. ^HHSZVRs0

